---
import Layout from '../../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="illusYn"
	description="AI-powered image generation, background removal, and canvas suite running on Workers AI."
>
	<p>
		<strong>illusYn</strong> is an advanced AI art studio that translates text descriptions and input images into high-fidelity visuals. Powered by Cloudflare's serverless AI inference registry, it provides content creators and designers with a full-featured workspace to generate, edit, crop, and isolate image elements instantly in their browsers.
	</p>

	<h2>Technical Stack</h2>

	<div class="specs-grid">
		<div class="spec-card">
			<div class="spec-header">
				<span class="spec-icon">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/></svg>
				</span>
				<h3>Edge Runtime & Models</h3>
			</div>
			<table class="spec-table">
				<tbody>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Inference Engine</td><td>Cloudflare Workers AI</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Text-to-Image</td><td><code>Stable Diffusion XL (SDXL)</code></td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Image-to-Image</td><td><code>Stable Diffusion XL Turbo</code></td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Segmentation</td><td><code>Segment Anything Model (SAM)</code> (Background removal)</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>

		<div class="spec-card">
			<div class="spec-header">
				<span class="spec-icon">
					<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"/><path d="M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5"/><path d="M3 12c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3"/></svg>
				</span>
				<h3>Data & Storage</h3>
			</div>
			<table class="spec-table">
				<tbody>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Image Bucket</td><td>Cloudflare R2 (Serverless Object Storage)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Metadata Cache</td><td>Cloudflare D1 (SQL Database)</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Language</td><td>TypeScript</td></tr>
					<tr><td class="spec-label">Bundler</td><td>Wrangler Assets</td></tr>
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="lab-note">
		<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><image x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" xlink:href=""/></svg>
		<span>
			<strong>Edge Storage Capabilities:</strong> Generated images and user-uploaded templates are stored inside **Cloudflare R2 Object Storage**, with their prompts, creation seeds, and dimensions cataloged in a **D1 SQL Database** to allow instant gallery loading and search filtering.
		</span>
	</div>

	<h2>Key Features</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Text-to-Image Generation</strong> — Compiles complex textual prompts into detailed digital paintings, vector assets, and illustrations.</li>
		<li><strong>Image-to-Image Redefinition</strong> — Allows users to upload baseline sketches or photographs and apply prompt styles to iterate on concepts while preserving structural integrity.</li>
		<li><strong>AI-Powered Background Removal</strong> — A premium inference tool that isolates objects using the Segment Anything Model (SAM), executing edge-based background subtraction in seconds.</li>
		<li><strong>Dynamic Canvas Cropping</strong> — An interactive in-browser cropping tool that lets creators adjust aspect ratios, isolate focal points, and re-encode outputs.</li>
	</ul>

	<div class="tech-tags">
		<span class="tag">Cloudflare Workers AI</span>
		<span class="tag">Stable Diffusion XL</span>
		<span class="tag">Segment Anything Model</span>
		<span class="tag">Cloudflare R2</span>
		<span class="tag">D1 Database</span>
		<span class="tag">TypeScript</span>
		<span class="tag">Image-to-Image</span>
		<span class="tag">In-Browser Editor</span>
	</div>

	<div class="back-link-wrapper">
		<a href="/portfolio" class="back-link">← Back to Portfolio</a>
	</div>
</Layout>

<style>
	.specs-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: 1.25rem;
		margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
	}

	.spec-card {
		padding: 1.25rem;
		background: rgba(30, 35, 50, 0.5);
		backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.12);
		border-radius: 10px;
		transition: border-color 0.3s ease;
	}

	.spec-card:hover {
		border-color: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.3);
	}

	.spec-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.spec-icon {
		color: var(--accent);
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.spec-header h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1rem;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
	}

	.spec-table {
		width: 100%;
		border-collapse: collapse;
	}

	.spec-table td {
		padding: 0.4rem 0;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.08);
	}

	.spec-table tr:last-child td {
		border-bottom: none;
	}

	.spec-label {
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		font-weight: 600;
		width: 5rem;
	}

	.lab-note {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 0.8rem;
		padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
		background: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.08);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.15);
		border-radius: 8px;
		margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.lab-note svg {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		color: var(--accent);
		margin-top: 0.15rem;
	}

	.tech-tags {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		margin: 2rem 0;
	}

	.tag {
		padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
		background: rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.12);
		border: 1px solid rgba(123, 158, 255, 0.2);
		border-radius: 4px;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	.back-link-wrapper {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(var(--gray-light), 0.3);
	}

	.back-link {
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: none;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
	}

	.back-link:hover {
		opacity: 0.8;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.specs-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
